  ],
  "translation": "Na yu, Selomo, pikinini bilong mi: save long ⟨את⟩ Elohim bilong papa bilong yu, na wokim ⟨em⟩ long bel i orait olgeta na long nefes i laikim ⟨en⟩; bilong Yahwe i save painim olgeta bel, na i save skelim olgeta fomin bilong ol tingting. Sapos yu painim em, em bai i stap long yu; tasol sapos yu lusim em, em bai troim yu we oltaim oltaim.",
